{"title":"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following is the largest?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/3/5d34491f2b15310484e5ac5f5022c7fb21e2cf17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{3} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{4} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{3}{8} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{5}{12} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\dfrac{7}{24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"367\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The least common denominator is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/8/d78e28c0b799ba57ad335978cad3d3aad3ebb59a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{lcm}(3, 4, 8, 12, 24) = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"183\" height=\"20\" />. The answer choices (A) to (E) are thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/2/6c298f865fec3dc6bb7ab22fc8def8927f343f14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8}{24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62dde6df647e64cc6d3d5c6ecf48fe910c09ea00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/3/c636a76ec45be643dd630dd4c833143b5dd478df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/3/dc39cf47e9da1964f134e58b7c7273512c2b9012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10}{24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66d160aa2a57171a37d829a71b82535bd2a65537.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />, so  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/0/3708dc31ea49734af1208afdd25a060fe5b504b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{5}{12}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"70\" height=\"49\" /> is the largest.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>C and D are the only answer choices where the numerator is close to half of the denominator. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/e/88e1ce44d71271ea58fc208de5db4c5cf07f4953.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{3}{8} = .375$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"69\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/1051b9f9dd080b23db629c288303bc36ec3a577c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{5}{12} \\approx .41$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"71\" height=\"38\" />. Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/2/0a25a2dfdfd4467b58c781f338e1a867de5f58d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(D)}\\ \\frac{5}{12}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"65\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME\" title=\"1994 AJHSME\">1994 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First <br /> Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>Th